     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "USU the neck = ⍉stiff initially (unless the cerebellar tonsils herniate); w.in 24 hrs chem meningitis → mod to marked meningismus, vomiting and sometimes bilat extensor plantar responses"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
